  "description": "The ZOOPER takes the best parts of a fat tire, moped style ebike and blends it with the classic ZOOZ look and robust build quality. The thick AF comfortable seat, 4\" tires, and front suspension fork soak up terrain like a boss! The extra weight of the large battery and reinforced frame makes the ZOOPER feel solid, planted, and built like a tank. Unlike most fat tire ebikes, we placed the cranks behind the center line of the bike, this gives the rider more control in turns, keeps the rider centered, and promotes playful riding…and THAT is a core ZOOZ principle!",
